# Generated stylesheet. `src/index.css` is compiled from `src/tailwind.css` by
# the tailwind CLI (see the `tailwind:build` / `tailwind:watch` scripts), so it
# is build output, not source. Both `npm run dev` and `npm run build` recreate
# it. Edit `src/tailwind.css` instead.
# Delete this line if you would rather commit the compiled CSS.
